#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:5 3aad4a9f6dc94013b944a6da11abbcec
msgid "Flight Modes"
msgstr "飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:7 f990ba6551e5426cb602f41631ff617d
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview and links to the available flight modes "
"for Blimp."
msgstr "本文概览 Blimp 可用的飞行模式，并给出各模式的详细链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:11 ea8e1ff6f091497ea2272f943c4aebbc
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:13 080b9b8d50aa4d46a497d25cfb09b4ab
msgid "Blimp has 5 built-in flight modes."
msgstr "Blimp 内置 5 种飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:15 82f72b36b8f849d5a7f5ba27d805b32e
msgid ""
"Flight modes are controlled through the radio (via a :ref:`transmitter "
"switch <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`), or using "
"commands from a ground station (GCS) or companion computer."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式可通过遥控（:ref:`遥控器开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration>`）切换，也可以由地面站（GCS）或机载伴随计算机发送指令切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:18 9e1fb5920ae34a0c87d47c69a2379495
msgid ""
"The table below shows for each flight mode whether it provides altitude or "
"position control, and whether it requires valid position information from a "
"sensor (typically a GPS) in order to arm or switch into this mode."
msgstr "下表列出各飞行模式是否提供高度或位置控制，以及解锁或切入该模式时是否需要传感器（通常是 GPS）提供有效的位置信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:40 025866ddbec74b18996304e249eded41
msgid "Recommended Flight Modes"
msgstr "推荐飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:42 046d66ebfbbd46d79186a77dbc8e3366
msgid ""
"It is best to start with manual mode to ensure the the actuators and rc "
"controller have been set up correctly (i.e. pushing the pitch stick forward "
"does make the blimp move forward)."
msgstr "建议先从 Manual 模式开始，以确认舵机和 RC 设置正确（例如俯仰摇杆向前推时飞艇会向前移动）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:44 cb255c106e0c49239428957603415fa5
msgid ""
"Once this is confirmed, you can switch into VELOCITY mode. This uses only "
"the velocity PID controller, thus allowing tuning this controller using the "
"VEL* parameters. Test whether centering the sticks results in a standstill "
"and no oscillation. Also test that the blimp reaches a set velocity "
"reasonably quickly."
msgstr ""
"确认无误后，可切换到 VELOCITY 模式。该模式只使用速度 PID 控制器，便于使用 VEL* "
"参数对其调参。测试摇杆居中时飞艇能否保持静止且不振荡。同时测试飞艇能否较快达到设定速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:47 51cc34f960274107bc34e6f423da5b18
msgid ""
"After this stage, you can switch into LOITER mode and check its performance."
" Generally the position controller should need less tuning (using the POS* "
"parameters), but some tuning may still be needed."
msgstr "此阶段完成后，可切换到 LOITER 模式并检查其性能。位置控制器通常需要的调参较少（使用 POS* 参数），但可能仍需少量调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:49 ff5d2adf59d549cfa0f58de8c12a8c9f
msgid ""
"LAND mode stops all servo outputs so that the Blimp will stop moving. It can"
" also be used as a pilot selected mode to save battery if the blimp needs to"
" wait. Note that since the blimp is still floating, it is likely to drift "
"with the wind, though it is recommended to have the blimp slightly "
"negatively buoyant so that the blimp will also go down and \"land\" when in "
"this mode."
msgstr ""
"LAND 模式会停止所有舵机输出，从而让 Blimp 停止运动。也可以作为飞手主动选择的模式，在需要等待时用于省电。注意 Blimp "
"仍处于漂浮状态，所以可能会被风吹动；建议把飞艇调到略微负浮力，这样在该模式下会逐渐下降并「降落」。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:51 9eda5fe3964f48758b5719c7a5daf11c
msgid ""
"Most transmitters can be setup to provide a 3 position switch that can be "
"set up to quickly switch between the most-used flight modes but you can find"
" instructions :ref:`here for setting up a 6-position flight mode switch "
"<common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"大多数遥控器可配置为三段开关，用于在最常用的飞行模式间快速切换；也可参考 :ref:`这里 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-"
"mode-configuration>` 配置六段飞行模式开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:54 13cc50bd9d6641eb8d4fa510a69666fd
msgid "GNSS Receiver (\"GPS\") Dependency"
msgstr "GNSS 接收机（「GPS」）依赖性"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:56 e01454e382b3425c97b29bae26c4d2d9
msgid ""
"Flight modes that use positioning data require valid position prior to "
"takeoff. When using GPS, to verify if your autopilot has acquired GPS lock, "
"connect to a ground station or consult your autopilot's hardware overview "
"page to see the LED indication for GPS lock."
msgstr ""
"使用位置数据的飞行模式要求起飞前已获取有效位置。使用 GPS 时，可通过连接地面站、或查看飞控硬件概览页中对应的 GPS 定位 LED "
"指示来确认是否完成 GPS 定位锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:60 70809a16cd8a411eb2bc6a21c5c7969a
msgid ""
"Below is a summary of position identification dependency for Copter flight "
"modes. Most often this position information is obtained via a GPS, but other"
" position sensors, such as 3D cameras or beacons, may be used and would need"
" to provide a valid location, for those modes requiring it, prior to arming."
msgstr ""
"以下汇总了 Copter 各飞行模式对位置信息的依赖情况。位置信息通常来源于 GPS，但 3D "
"相机、信标等其他位置传感器也可使用——对于需要位置信息的模式，必须在解锁前提供有效位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:63 ad771805a831481d8f81dad71efc0858
msgid "Requires valid position prior to takeoff:"
msgstr "起飞前需要有效位置信息的模式："

