msgstr "ROLL（横滚）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:81 d94da19696654b609fca222a8fefbde6
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Lateral movement, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to obtain "
":ref:`MAX_VEL_XY<MAX_VEL_XY>` m/s laterally, LOITER: Full throw attempts to "
"obtain :ref:`MAX_POS_XY<MAX_POS_XY>` m/s laterally"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：横向移动；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试达到 :ref:`MAX_VEL_XY<MAX_VEL_XY>` m/s "
"的横向速度；LOITER：满杆时尝试达到 :ref:`MAX_POS_XY<MAX_POS_XY>` m/s 的横向速度"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:84 97e14e8e62484b20bc1478a271eec2d3
msgid "PITCH"
msgstr "PITCH（俯仰）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:84 0c27b4e932ff4901ad8c49cb8d96eb80
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Fore/Aft movement, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to obtain "
":ref:`MAX_VEL_XY<MAX_VEL_XY>` m/s  fore/aft, LOITER: Full throw attempts to "
"obtain :ref:`MAX_POS_XY<MAX_POS_XY>` m/s  fore/aft"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：前后移动；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试达到 :ref:`MAX_VEL_XY<MAX_VEL_XY>` m/s "
"的前后速度；LOITER：满杆时尝试达到 :ref:`MAX_POS_XY<MAX_POS_XY>` m/s 的前后速度"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:87 32e9ebbefa8f4183b44fc9e7c5847359
msgid "YAW"
msgstr "YAW（偏航）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:87 217b9f9730034de48cc619c5ee804eef
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Yaw, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to increase/decrease heading "
":ref:`MAX_VEL_YAW<MAX_VEL_YAW>` radians/s  fore/aft, LOITER: Full throw "
"attempts to increase/decrease heading :ref:`MAX_POS_YAW<MAX_POS_XY>` "
"radians/s  fore/aft"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：偏航；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试以 :ref:`MAX_VEL_YAW<MAX_VEL_YAW>` rad/s "
"的角速度增加/减小航向；LOITER：满杆时尝试以 :ref:`MAX_POS_YAW<MAX_POS_XY>` rad/s 的角速度增加/减小航向"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:90 a1913a0cf8d7468cb52db4bd86a69f36
msgid "THROTTLE"
msgstr "THROTTLE（油门）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:90 ba9e42bffca34fcda7282d0da0117d60
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Ascend/Descend, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to increase/decrease "
"altitude :ref:`MAX_VEL_Z<MAX_VEL_Z>` m/s, LOITER: Full throw attempts to "
"increase/decrease heading :ref:`MAX_POS_Z<MAX_POS_Z>` m/s"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：上升/下降；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试以 :ref:`MAX_VEL_Z<MAX_VEL_Z>` m/s "
"的速度增加/减小高度；LOITER：满杆时尝试以 :ref:`MAX_POS_Z<MAX_POS_Z>` m/s 的速度增加/减小高度"
